                </a>
                <a href="#product-owner" class="px-3 py-1 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-500/20 hover:bg-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-200 transition border border-emerald-500/30">
                    👑 Product Owner
                </a>
                <a href="#database" class="px-3 py-1 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-500/20 hover:bg-indigo-500/30 text-indigo-200 transition border border-indigo-500/30">
                    🗄️ Especialista BD
                </a>
                <a href="#sinergia" class="px-3 py-1 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold bg-amber-500/20 hover:bg-amber-500/30 text-amber-200 transition border border-amber-500/30">
                    🤝 Trabajo en Equipo
                </a>
                <a href="#modulos" class="px-3 py-1 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold bg-purple-500/20 hover:bg-purple-500/30 text-purple-200 transition border border-purple-500/30">
                    🏢 10 Módulos
                </a>
                <a href="#videos" class="px-3 py-1 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold bg-rose-500/20 hover:bg-rose-500/30 text-rose-200 transition border border-rose-500/30">
                    📹 Videotutoriales
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="absolute -right-16 -bottom-16 w-72 h-72 bg-cyan-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- ========================================================================= -->
    <!-- ⚡ SECCIÓN 1: ONBOARDING & ARQUITECTURA BASE                               -->
    <!-- ========================================================================= -->
    <section id="onboarding" class="scroll-mt-24 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-3">
            <span class="text-xl">⚡</span>
            <div>
                <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">1. Inicio Rápido & Arquitectura Base</h2>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Cómo configurar tu entorno local y conectarte al backend en la nube en menos de 3 minutos.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
            <!-- Tarjeta 1: Stack -->
            <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-[#111827] border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm space-y-2">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 uppercase tracking-wider">Stack Tecnológico</span>
                    <span class="badge badge-xs badge-neutral text-[10px]">.NET 10 LTS</span>
                </div>
                <ul class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 space-y-1.5 pt-1">
                    <li>• <strong>Backend:</strong> C# 13 en .NET 10 LTS Modular</li>
                    <li>• <strong>Frontend:</strong> ASP.NET Core MVC + Tailwind + DaisyUI</li>
                    <li>• <strong>Base de Datos:</strong> PostgreSQL 16 Cloud en GCP</li>
                    <li>• <strong>Aislamiento:</strong> 1 Esquema soberano por equipo</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Tarjeta 2: CLI dev.sh -->
            <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-[#111827] border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm space-y-2">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 uppercase tracking-wider">CLI Asistido (5 Opciones)</span>
                    <span class="badge badge-xs badge-primary text-[10px]">dev.sh</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
